// Magic Damage
ItemDisplay[WEAPON (MAG OR RARE OR CRAFT) STAT357>0]:%WHITE%%STAT357%%ORANGE%%PERCENT%m%CS%%NAME%{%NAME%}%CONTINUE%

// -% Enemy Fire Resist
